			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "RX 检测与增益",
			"fontSize": 15,
			"fontFamily": 2,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "RX 检测与增益",
			"lineHeight": 1.35,
			"baseline": 15,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "b1e",
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null
		},
		{
			"id": "el0166",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 872,
			"y": 502.74999999999994,
			"width": 441.3984375,
			"height": 145.8,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#343a40",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1156697262,
			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 772910534,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1789655940823,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "【LMT Peak】LNA/Mixer/TIA 模拟峰值过载（可能是带外干扰）。\n【ADC Peak】ADC 输出 +4/−4 样本过多 → 过载。\n【Low Power】平均功率低于门限（0～−63.5 dBFS，0.5 dB/LSB）。\n【Digital Sat】数字链饱和。\n【RSSI】接收强度；Preamble / Symbol 两套寄存器，含当前增益。\n  测点在 HB1 输出与 FIR 输入之间。\n【Full 增益表】一个指针扫 LNA/Mixer/TIA/LPF/数字。\n【Split 增益表】LMT 与 LPF 指针分开，强干扰时只降过载区。\n【增益路径】外部LNA → 内部LNA → Mixer Gm → TIA → LPF(0–24 dB) → 数字。",
			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 2,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "【LMT Peak】LNA/Mixer/TIA 模拟峰值过载（可能是带外干扰）。\n【ADC Peak】ADC 输出 +4/−4 样本过多 → 过载。\n【Low Power】平均功率低于门限（0～−63.5 dBFS，0.5 dB/LSB）。\n【Digital Sat】数字链饱和。\n【RSSI】接收强度；Preamble / Symbol 两套寄存器，含当前增益。\n  测点在 HB1 输出与 FIR 输入之间。\n【Full 增益表】一个指针扫 LNA/Mixer/TIA/LPF/数字。\n【Split 增益表】LMT 与 LPF 指针分开，强干扰时只降过载区。\n【增益路径】外部LNA → 内部LNA → Mixer Gm → TIA → LPF(0–24 dB) → 数字。",
			"lineHeight": 1.35,
			"baseline": 12,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "b1f",
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null
		},
