			"type": "text",
			"x": 872,
			"y": 1428.2,
			"width": 385.74609375,
			"height": 81.00000000000001,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#343a40",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1465375875,
			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 2083445914,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1789655940823,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1. BBBW ≠ 复带宽：BBBW ≈ 复带宽 / 2。\n2. 1.4 / 1.6 / 2.5 / 5 ×BBBW：都是滤波器角点相对基带带宽的经验倍数。\n3. 抽取/内插顺序：Rx 先滤波后抽取；Tx 先内插后滤波。\n4. 模拟增益改动态范围；数字增益只缩放，不改 SNR。\n5. HB3 的 ÷3 与 INT3 的 ×3 必须同时设置，否则时钟对不齐。",
			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 2,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "1. BBBW ≠ 复带宽：BBBW ≈ 复带宽 / 2。\n2. 1.4 / 1.6 / 2.5 / 5 ×BBBW：都是滤波器角点相对基带带宽的经验倍数。\n3. 抽取/内插顺序：Rx 先滤波后抽取；Tx 先内插后滤波。\n4. 模拟增益改动态范围；数字增益只缩放，不改 SNR。\n5. HB3 的 ÷3 与 INT3 的 ×3 必须同时设置，否则时钟对不齐。",
			"lineHeight": 1.35,
			"baseline": 12,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "b1o",
